{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05172","headline":"和张燕公湘中九日登高 · 阴行先","name":"和张燕公湘中九日登高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳初启节，无射正飞灰。\n寂寞风蝉至，连翩霜鴈来。\n山棠红叶下，岸菊紫花开。\n今日桓公座，多愧孟嘉才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阴行先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}